  "_the_finding": "P-I1's mutual arm cannot express a p-value at all on the axis `formation_curve_payload` builds: 384 heads, 268 of them with no relay anywhere, and `change_profile` refuses each one. On the 116 heads that do form it emits (0.4203 against the measured behavioural series \u2014 the two curves do not co-locate on the raw count, ~2.02 log-steps apart with the behaviour leading \u2014 and 0.0004998 against a perfectly co-locating B side, which is its floor). And the floor it reported was the draw-count half alone: at 10 units with 9 sharing one location the reported floor was 0.000500 against an attainable 0.100000, a factor of 200. On the real 116 heads the tie half is 10^-148 and does not bind \u2014 it binds on the set a relay-count null leaves, which is why this is step 1 and not a footnote to step 4."
